00:32:39,479 --> 00:32:42,225
can we enable these models to generate natural language?

493
00:32:45,051 --> 00:32:48,953
And what we have seen again in the past weeks

494
00:32:49,453 --> 00:32:52,968
is that usually the models that we use are autoregressive

495
00:32:53,468 --> 00:32:57,025
in nature. You can actually train them in parallel the way we saw in Transformers.

496
00:32:57,217 --> 00:33:01,335
But at generation time, all these models are autoregressive because they predict

497
00:33:01,835 --> 00:33:06,591
next tokens based on the values of past tokens. There are also diffusion models,

498
00:33:06,911 --> 00:33:10,853
which is not a part of this course. If you're interested, you can actually read

