00:34:20,412 --> 00:34:23,922
4 or 5 weeks. But the goal is, again, as I was saying, coming back

518
00:34:24,422 --> 00:34:28,026
to the aspect that these models are autoregressive. So what happens is that the token

519
00:34:28,526 --> 00:34:31,953
generated at a specific time t is actually fed back as the input of the

520
00:34:32,453 --> 00:34:36,089
model at time t plus 1. And then it actually generates another token at

521
00:34:36,121 --> 00:34:39,247
time t plus 1. And this keeps on going on and on. And this is

522
00:34:39,747 --> 00:34:42,823
how models generate text. So basically,

523
00:34:43,496 --> 00:34:46,751
the key aspect is that, as you can see, is that it's mostly repetition

