00:36:06,880 --> 00:36:10,354
get is a score. And what you do is, based on the score of vectors,

547
00:36:10,466 --> 00:36:13,831
you actually apply the softmax transformation that we've also discussed at length

548
00:36:13,911 --> 00:36:17,725
in the past, which then converts this into a probability distribution,

549
00:36:18,638 --> 00:36:22,580
p, over all the set of vocabulary words or vocabulary tokens

550
00:36:23,285 --> 00:36:26,810
based on this score. And as shorthand, I'm just going to

