00:37:20,976 --> 00:37:24,143
you a token at this place. And not just a probability distribution.

566
00:37:25,121 --> 00:37:28,505
And just to kind of think about this, we go

567
00:37:28,665 --> 00:37:32,257
a bit deeply into this, is basically let's take this example of he wanted to

