00:37:53,430 --> 00:37:56,448
given this context that we have received so far?

574
00:37:57,443 --> 00:38:01,312
And what we have to do is have to take— to

575
00:38:01,812 --> 00:38:05,373
convert— to basically select a specific token which we can then

