00:38:25,933 --> 00:38:30,816
actually select a token from this distribution that

582
00:38:31,188 --> 00:38:35,167
is then going to generate something that we

583
00:38:35,667 --> 00:38:39,143
get at timestep t. Then we keep going with this step so that we can

584
00:38:39,643 --> 00:38:41,805
keep generating the text that we want from this model.

585
00:38:43,197 --> 00:38:46,782
So you can just see is that the decoding function is just

586
00:38:47,153 --> 00:38:50,949
something that ingests the probability distribution and gives you a

